This project bundles or builds on third-party software:

* Regorus (https://github.com/microsoft/regorus) — a Rego interpreter written in
  Rust. MIT License, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. A trimmed WebAssembly
  build is vendored in vendor/regorus/ (see vendor/regorus/PROVENANCE.md).

* GOPAL — Governance Open Policy Agent Library
  (https://github.com/Principled-Evolution/gopal). Apache License 2.0. Selected
  Rego policies (helper_functions, global, international) are vendored unmodified
  in policies/vendor/gopal/ at a pinned commit, together with its LICENSE.

* Cloudflare Agents SDK (https://github.com/cloudflare/agents) — MIT.

* The GitHub App authentication helpers are adapted from
  Clawbuilders/cloudflare-code-reviewer (MIT).

This project flags risks for humans to review. It is not legal advice, and the
regulatory citations it emits are pointers — verify them with qualified counsel.
